<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: ICE HOCKEY - CZECH REPUBLIC BEATS NORWAY IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY - CZECH REPUBLIC BEATS NORWAY IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>NYMBURK, Czech Republic 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic beat Norway 6-1 (3-0 1-1 2-0) in an ice hockey friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Slegr (6, 60), Ujcik (14), Moravec (18), Kapusta (38), Vyborny (51)</p>
<p>Norway - Vikingstad (32)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,500</p>
